From: rams95 <rams95@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 12:24:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 0016-native-options-mouse-look.patch

The game's Options screen (PS2_NATIVE_MENU=ADDRESS=VALUE): a sign says Select opens the PC settings, which open in the look of
that screen with the game's own font (PS2_MENU_FONT, made by tools/rd_prompts.py); Back returns to the game. The same look is a
third menu look (keys.ini menu_skin = game).
Mouse look (PS2_MOUSE_LOOK_YAW / _PITCH / _WHEN): the right stick is pushed just enough and the game's camera angle and height
are read back every frame, so the camera turns as far as the mouse moved; Settings > Controls: mouse look, speed, invert.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QNLFPekqhcU2dj7B3Utmea
